    "result_text": "Done. The build passes and the test suite is green (`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## What changed\n\nThe `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` fields (plus the derived `checkDigit`) are unified into a single **`memberId`** formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` \u2014 e.g. the audit log now emits `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (region `NSW`, fiscal year `27`, HASH8 `16E6609E`, Luhn check digit `1`).\n\n**Identity computation**\n- `mapper/CustomerCode.java` \u2192 renamed to **`mapper/MemberId.java`**. `of(region, fiscalYear, telephone, lastName)` now builds `region + FY + HASH8` and appends `CheckDigit.luhn(core)` as the CHK segment. `hash8(...)` is unchanged (same SHA-256-over-`telephone+lastName` first-8-upper-hex). `locality(owner)` parses the REGION prefix out of the memberId (stripping any `-<n>` collision suffix), falling back to `CityRegion` for seed data.\n- `rest/function/owner/AssignCustomerCode.java` \u2192 renamed to **`AssignMemberId.java`**. Collision handling (`-<n>` suffix) now applies to the whole `memberId`.\n\n**Storage**\n- `model/Owner.java`: `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`.\n- DB schemas (hsqldb, h2, mysql, postgres): column renamed and widened to `VARCHAR(32)`/`TEXT` to fit the concatenated id plus any collision suffix.\n\n**Exposure & derived values**\n- `openapi.yml`: removed `customerCode`, `membershipNumber`, `checkDigit`; added `memberId`; updated the `locality` description.\n- `mapper/OwnerMapper.java`: dropped the `membershipNumber` and `checkDigit` mappings; `memberId` auto-maps; `locality`/`timezone` now go through `MemberId.locality`; reverse-mapping ignore target updated to `memberId`.\n- `mapper/OwnerSegment.java`: the owner segment's AREA now references the memberId via `MemberId.locality`.\n- `rest/function/owner/AuditOwnerCreated.java` + `OwnerCreatedEvent.java`: the audit line and the structured JSON event's primary identifier (JSON key `memberId`) now source the memberId.\n- YAML pipeline step `assignCustomerCode` \u2192 `assignMemberId`; `FiscalYear` docs updated.\n\n`CheckDigit.luhn` is retained \u2014 it now computes the CHK segment inside `memberId` rather than the removed standalone field.",
